{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kosenki</strong> is a fast-paced, stylish combat game set in a dark techno-feudal world consumed by endless war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across a continent divided into three warring nations, a fragile balance has held for centuries; until the discovery of <i>Kosenki</i>, a powerful mineral that propelled technology forward, and accelerated conflict even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Hayato, a battle-worn samurai haunted by the ghosts of his past. Once driven by honor and revenge, he now fights to find purpose in a world that no longer remembers peace. His enemies are not only the soldiers of rival nations, but the shadows that dwell within his own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with speed and intention; every slash, parry, and decision carries weight. Every encounter demands precision, and every strike tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kosenki blends intense, skill-based action with a deeply personal story about duty, trauma, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endure the war within.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121220?t=1769050795","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121220?t=1769050795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/eeb84177f23987a4ffdae8698864ea87b6925f9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769050795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/eeb84177f23987a4ffdae8698864ea87b6925f9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769050795","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kosenki</strong> is a fast-paced, stylish combat game set in a dark techno-feudal world consumed by endless war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across a continent divided into three warring nations, a fragile balance has held for centuries; until the discovery of <i>Kosenki</i>, a powerful mineral that propelled technology forward, and accelerated conflict even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Hayato, a battle-worn samurai haunted by the ghosts of his past. Once driven by honor and revenge, he now fights to find purpose in a world that no longer remembers peace. His enemies are not only the soldiers of rival nations, but the shadows that dwell within his own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with speed and intention; every slash, parry, and decision carries weight. Every encounter demands precision, and every strike tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kosenki blends intense, skill-based action with a deeply personal story about duty, trauma, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endure the war within.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Eyeheim Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121220/bd5e7b51057ad2d35f519aae1cfc3ff04cbf9a12/header.jpg?t=1769050795","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Kosenki","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 8.1, 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 3220 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 6600 or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><stro